ain-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/838553-chronicles-of-dankness-parody-series?p=872108#post872108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">less screaming good, maybe still a little loud (seems louder than the hulu video I have on) definitely amusing but I don't think you'd need the whole thing for every vampire episode.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I was simply talking about the style of the intro. Basically, it's an opening skit followed by the title and song, that's all. I have no idea how it got so loud though, the original video wasn't that loud. I'll look into it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T10:37:43-07:00","id":872487,"title":"","content":"God bless you for keeping the Andrew W.K. opening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T11:27:48-07:00","id":872542,"title":"","content":"I quite like it, though I will miss the Spooky Scary Skeletons. Perhaps that can be the theme for the general CoD videos?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T14:07:36-07:00","id":990623,"title":"","content":"Hooo, haven't made a new episode since...April. Damn, that is a long time to wait, and I'm sorry for doing that to you guys. The wait for the Vampire episode is now over:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h73sj07yxYM&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-code=\"h73sj07yxYM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/h73sj07yxYM/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> I really gotta get off my butt and start making these episodes on a regular basis. Anywho, for the Ventrues in a nutshell skit, I originally intended to use <a href=\"https://vine.co/v/h3I22b07qWe\" target=\"_blank\">this video</a>, but since my video-editing software was being a bitch and didn't even register the damn clip no matter what I tried, I simply went &quot;Fuck it, let's see what I can get outta Luke Valentine&quot;, and that's why you see the skit before you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowKnight1224</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/838553-chronicles-of-dankness-parody-series?p=872542#post872542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I quite like it, though I will miss the Spooky Scary Skeletons. Perhaps that can be the theme for the general CoD videos?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, Spooky Scary Skeletons will be the theme for general episodes. Party Party Party is only gonna be used for Vampire episodes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 10-20-2016, 05:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T14:25:48-07:00","id":991115,"title":"","content":"I heavily approve of the use of Hellsing Abridged!<br /> Just found this. Watched it all. Need more now xD<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T14:51:02-07:00","id":991536,"title":"","content":"Frigging Strix.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","